    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-2026-07-09T16:04:06.083247+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T16:04:06.083247+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.1.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "You\\'re at the creek bank. Before we measure anything — what\\'s the first thing you notice about the water right here versus ten feet upstream?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "水边的你。在我们开始测量之前——你注意到这儿的水与十英尺上游相比有什么不同吗？",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.1.text-2026-07-09T16:04:06.083247+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.1.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-2026-07-09T16:04:06.083247+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T16:04:06.083247+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.2.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "It\\'s slower here and there\\'s more mud on the bottom."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "这里有点慢，底部有更多泥巴。",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.2.text-2026-07-09T16:04:06.083247+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.2.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-2026-07-09T16:04:28.147541+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T16:04:28.147541+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.3.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Good observation. Why do you think the mud settled here and not upstream where the water is faster?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "为什么您认为泥浆在这里沉积而不是上游水流更快的地方？",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.3.text-2026-07-09T16:04:28.147541+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.3.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-2026-07-09T16:04:28.147541+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T16:04:28.147541+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.4.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "Maybe slower water can\\'t carry as much stuff?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "水可能不如快的能运载那么多东西？",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.4.text-2026-07-09T16:04:28.147541+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.4.text"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-2026-07-09T16:04:28.147541+00:00",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "prov:startTime": "2026-07-09T16:04:28.147541+00:00",
      "actor": {
        "@id": "agent:OLLAMA-mistral-nemo_12b_Profile__General_Balanced_Content_|_Temp__0.3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.5.text",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "That\\'s the right direction. What could you measure or photograph here to support that idea?"
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "那方向是对的。你能在这里测量或拍照来支持这个想法吗？",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-meet_peri.exchange.5.text-2026-07-09T16:04:28.147541+00:00"
      },
      "used_source": {
        "@id": "entity:source-meet_peri.exchange.5.text"
      }
    },
